<%page args="mode, auth_success='', auth_next='/'"/>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN" class="dark"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#121212">
<title>${'注册' if mode == 'register' else '登录'}—消痕侠数字痕迹管理平台</title>
<link rel="icon" href="${docroot}/static/img/xhen-brand.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="${docroot}/static/react-auth/auth.css?v=auth-restored-1">
<script defer src="${docroot}/static/react-auth/auth.js?v=auth-restored-1"></script>
</head><body>
<div id="auth-root" data-mode="${mode | h}" data-docroot="${docroot | h}" data-csrf-token="${csrf_token | h}" data-error="${error or '' | h}" data-success="${auth_success | h}" data-next="${auth_next | h}" data-version="${version | h}">
<main class="auth-fallback"><h1>${'创建账号' if mode == 'register' else '登录消痕侠'}</h1><p>数字痕迹管理平台</p>
% if error:
<p role="alert">${error | h}</p>
% endif
% if auth_success:
<p role="status">${auth_success | h}</p>
% endif
<form method="post" action="${docroot}/${mode}"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="${csrf_token | h}">
% if mode == 'login':
<input type="hidden" name="next" value="${auth_next | h}">
% endif
<label for="username">用户名</label><input id="username" name="username" type="text" required autocomplete="username" maxlength="${32 if mode == 'register' else 64}">
<label for="password">密码</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="${'new-password' if mode == 'register' else 'current-password'}">
% if mode == 'register':
<label for="confirm">确认密码</label><input id="confirm" name="confirm" type="password" required autocomplete="new-password">
% endif
<button type="submit">${'创建账号' if mode == 'register' else '登录工作区'}</button></form>
<a href="${docroot}/${'login' if mode == 'register' else 'register'}">${'已有账号？立即登录' if mode == 'register' else '新用户注册'}</a>
<p>仅查询本人或已获授权的目标。当前数据源未发现匹配，不代表不存在相关信息。</p><noscript>JavaScript 未启用，仍可使用此表单登录与注册。</noscript></main>
</div></body></html>
